UnitPPRouterNative::depositExactSharesNative
├── It succeeds and refunds excess
├── It consumes exact quote with no refund
├── It reverts when msg value below quote
├── It reverts on erc20 mode router
├── It reverts on asset mismatch
├── It reverts on zero value
└── It emits Deposited

UnitPPRouterNative::depositExactShares
└── It still accepts weth on native router

UnitPPRouterNative::withdrawToUnderlying
├── It delivers native with fee
├── It combines gas funding with payout
├── It reverts below min underlying
└── It reverts when recipient rejects native

UnitPPRouterNative::receive
├── It reverts on direct send to native router
└── It reverts on direct send to erc20 router

UnitPPRouterNative::constructor
└── It reverts on native mode with plain erc20 underlying

UnitPPRouterNative::createRouterNative
├── It deploys native mode router
└── It reverts on plain erc20 underlying
